# Student Notes Web App

A full-stack web app for summarizing textbooks, extracting definitions & formulas, and saving notes securely.

## 🚀 Features
- Upload textbooks (PDF/DOCX)
- AI-powered summarization (Hugging Face)
- Bullet-point study notes
- Keyword extraction (definitions & formulas)
- Secure authentication (JWT)
- Notes stored in MongoDB Atlas
- Export notes to PDF/Word

